msgid "Running Molpro on parallel computers"
msgstr "在并行计算机上运行 Molpro"

msgid ""
"Molpro will run on distributed-memory multiprocessor systems, including "
"workstation clusters, under the control of the `Global Arrays "
"<http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/docs/global>`__ parallel toolkit or the MPI-2 "
"library. There are also some parts of the code that can take advantage of "
"shared memory parallelism through the `OpenMP <http://www.openmp.org>`__ "
"protocol, although these are somewhat limited, and this facility is not at "
"present recommended. It should be noted that there remain some parts of the "
"code that are not, or only partly, parallelized, and therefore run with "
"replicated work. Additionally, some of those parts which have been "
"parallelized rely on fast inter-node communications, and can be very "
"inefficient across ordinary networks. Therefore some caution and "
"experimentation is needed to avoid waste of resources in a multiuser "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 可在分布式内存多处理器系统（包括工作站集群）上运行，由 `Global Arrays "
"<http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/docs/global>`__ 并行工具包或 MPI-2 库控制。代码中也有一些部分可以通过 "
"`OpenMP <http://www.openmp.org>`__ "
"协议利用共享内存并行性，尽管这些部分较为有限，并且目前不推荐使用此功能。需要注意的是，代码中仍有一些部分未并行化或仅部分并行化，因此会以重复工作的方式运行。此外，一些已并行化的部分依赖于快速的节点间通信，在普通网络上可能效率极低。因此，在多用户环境中需要谨慎并进行实验，以避免资源浪费。"

msgid "GA Installation notes"
msgstr "GA 安装说明"

msgid "Specifying parallel execution"
msgstr "指定并行执行"

msgid ""
"The following additional options for the ``molpro`` command may be used to "
"specify and control parallel execution. In addition, appropriate memory "
"specifications (``-m, -M, -G``) are important, see section `memory "
"specifications <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-"
"specifications>`__."
msgstr ""
"以下 ``molpro`` 命令的附加选项可用于指定和控制并行执行。此外，适当的内存规格（\\ ``-m, -M, -G``\\ ）也很重要，请参阅 "
"`memory specifications <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-"
"specifications>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"``--all-outputs`` produces an output file for each process when running in "
"parallel."
msgstr "``--all-outputs`` 在并行运行时为每个进程生成一个输出文件。"

msgid "Memory specifications"
msgstr "内存规格"

msgid ""
"If the `#disk option <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-"
"option>`__ is disabled (the default) and one of the older GA runtimes "
"(``sockets``, ``openib``, etc.) is used: Sufficient amount of GA memory must"
" be specified by the ``-G`` or ``-M`` option (see below) and pre-allocated "
"by Molpro in the beginning of a calculation, otherwise the calculation may "
"crash or yields incorrect results."
msgstr ""
"如果 `#disk option <.html#disk-option>`__ 被禁用（默认）并且使用了较旧的 GA 运行时（如 "
"``sockets``\\ 、\\ ``openib`` 等）：必须通过 ``-G`` 或 ``-M`` 选项（见下文）指定足够的 GA 内存，并由 "
"Molpro 在计算开始时预分配，否则计算可能崩溃或产生错误结果。"

msgid ""
"If the disk option is disabled and one of the comex-based GA runtimes (e.g. "
"``mpi-pr``) is used, or if the disk option is enabled but the scratch is in "
"a tmpfs: the ``-G`` or ``-M`` option is not mandatory, but sufficient "
"physical memory shall be left for the global data structure."
msgstr ""
"如果磁盘选项被禁用且使用了基于comex的GA运行时（例如 ``mpi-pr``\\ ），或者磁盘选项已启用但临时目录位于tmpfs中：\\ "
"``-G`` 或 ``-M`` 选项不是强制性的，但应为全局数据结构预留足够的物理内存。"

msgid ""
"Note that we have made the disk option the default in single node "
"calculations since Molpro 2021.2. If this causes performance problems, the "
"previous behavior of storing large data structure in GlobalArrays can be "
"enabled by setting the environment variable ``MOLPRO_GA_IMPL`` to ``GA``, or"
" by passing the ``--ga-impl ga`` command-line option."
msgstr ""
"请注意，自Molpro 2021.2起，我们已在单节点计算中将磁盘选项设为默认。如果这导致性能问题，可以通过将环境变量 "
"``MOLPRO_GA_IMPL`` 设置为 ``GA``\\ ，或通过传递 ``--ga-impl ga`` "
"命令行选项，来启用将大型数据结构存储在GlobalArrays中的先前行为。"

msgid ""
"Both the ``-m`` and ``-G`` options are by default given in megawords (m) but"
" unit gigaword (g) can also be used (e.g. ``-m1000`` is equivalent to "
"``-m1000m`` and to ``-m1g``). The total memory :math:`M` per node allocated "
"by molpro amounts to :math:`(n \\cdot m+G)/N`, where :math:`n` is the total "
"number of processes (``-n`` option), :math:`m` is the stack memory per "
"process (``-m`` option), :math:`G` the GA memory (``-G`` option), and "
":math:`N` the number of nodes. In addition, at least 200 MW per process "
"should be added for the program itself. In total, a calculation needs about "
":math:`8\\cdot[n\\cdot(m+0.3)+G]/N` GB (gigabytes) of memory (:math:`n,m,G` "
"in gw), and this should not exceed the physical memory of the machine(s) "
"used. We do note that in many calculations leaving some memory for the "
"system to buffer I/O operations may improve the performance significantly."
msgstr ""
"``-m`` 和 ``-G`` 选项默认以兆字（m）为单位给出，但也可以使用千兆字（g）单位（例如，\\ ``-m1000`` 等价于 "
"``-m1000m`` 和 ``-m1g``\\ ）。Molpro为每个节点分配的总内存 :math:`M` 为 :math:`(n \\cdot "
"m+G)/N`\\ ，其中 :math:`n` 是进程总数（\\ ``-n`` 选项），\\ :math:`m` 是每个进程的栈内存（\\ ``-m``"
" 选项），\\ :math:`G` 是GA内存（\\ ``-G`` 选项），\\ :math:`N` 是节点数。此外，程序本身每个进程至少应增加200 "
"MW。总计，一次计算大约需要 :math:`8\\cdot[n\\cdot(m+0.3)+G]/N` GB（千兆字节）的内存（\\ "
":math:`n,m,G` "
"以gw为单位），且不应超过所用机器的物理内存。我们确实注意到，在许多计算中，为系统预留一些内存用于缓冲I/O操作可能会显著提高性能。"

msgid ""
"**Density fitting and PNO calculations**: divide the memory into equal parts"
" for GA and stack memory."
msgstr "**密度拟合和PNO计算**\\ ：将内存平均分配给GA和栈内存。"

msgid ""
"**Canonical MRCI or CCSD(T) calculations** on one-node: no GA space is "
"needed."
msgstr "**单节点上的正则MRCI或CCSD(T)计算**\\ ：不需要GA空间。"

msgid ""
"If the ``-G`` or ``-M`` options are given, some programs check at early "
"stages if the GA space is sufficient. If not, an error exit occurs and the "
"estimated amount of required GA is printed. In this case the calculation "
"should be repeated, specifying (at least) the printed amount of GA space "
"with the ``-G`` option. If crashes without such message occur, the "
"calculation should also be repeated with more GA space or with the disk "
"option, but care should be taken that the total memory per node does not get"
" too large."
msgstr ""
"如果给出了 ``-G`` 或 ``-M`` 选项，一些程序会在早期阶段检查 GA 空间是否足够。如果不够，会发生错误退出并打印估计所需的 GA "
"量。在这种情况下，应重复计算，并使用 ``-G`` 选项指定（至少）打印出的 GA 空间量。如果发生崩溃但没有此类消息，也应使用更多 GA "
"空间或磁盘选项重复计算，但应注意确保每个节点的总内存不会变得过大。"

msgid "The behavior of various option combinations is as follows:"
msgstr "各种选项组合的行为如下："

msgid "``-M`` As described above."
msgstr "``-M`` 如上所述。"

msgid ""
"``-m`` The specified amount of :math:`m` is allocated. An infinite amount of"
" GA space is assumed, but nothing is preallocated or checked."
msgstr "``-m`` 分配指定的 :math:`m` 量。假定 GA 空间无限，但不预分配或检查任何内容。"

msgid ""
"``-G`` The specified amount of :math:`G` is allocated, and the same total "
"amount for stack memory (i.e. :math:`M=2G`)."
msgstr "``-G`` 分配指定的 :math:`G` 量，并为栈内存分配相同的总量（即 :math:`M=2G`\\ ）。"

msgid "``nothing`` Same as -m32m."
msgstr "``nothing`` 与 -m32m 相同。"

msgid ""
"If the ``-G`` or ``-M`` are present, the GA space is preallocated unless GA "
"is using helper processes (i.e., a comix-based runtime is used and "
"preallocation of GA is not necessary). If neither ``-G`` nor ``-M`` are "
"given, no preallocation and no checks of GA space are performed."
msgstr ""
"如果存在 ``-G`` 或 ``-M``\\ ，则预分配 GA 空间，除非 GA 正在使用辅助进程（即，使用基于 comix 的运行时，且不需要预分配 "
"GA）。如果未给出 ``-G`` 或 ``-M``\\ ，则不执行 GA 空间的预分配和检查。"

msgid "Disk option"
msgstr "磁盘选项"

msgid ""
"Since version 2021.1, Molpro can use MPI files instead of GlobalArrays to "
"store large global data. This option can be enabled globally by setting the "
"environment variable ``MOLPRO_GA_IMPL`` to ``DISK``, or by passing the "
"``--ga-impl disk`` command-line option. Since version 2021.2 the disk option"
" is made the default in single-node calculations. Some programs in Molpro "
"including DF-HF, DF-KS, (DF-)MULTI, DF-TDDFT, and PNO-LCCSD also support an "
"input option ``implementation=disk`` to enable the disk option for the "
"particular job step. The file system for these MPI files must be accessible "
"by all processors. By default the default Molpro scratch directory is used, "
"but another directory can be chosen for MPI Files using the ``-D`` command "
"line option or the ``MOLPRO_GLOBAL_SCRATCH`` environment variable. The "
"directory can be tmpfs (e.g., ``-D /dev/shm``) in single-node calculations, "
"and in this case the GAs / MPI Files are kept in shared memory."
msgstr ""
"自 2021.1 版本起，Molpro 可以使用 MPI 文件代替 GlobalArrays 来存储大型全局数据。可以通过将环境变量 "
"``MOLPRO_GA_IMPL`` 设置为 ``DISK``\\ ，或传递 ``--ga-impl disk`` 命令行选项来全局启用此选项。自 "
"2021.2 版本起，磁盘选项在单节点计算中成为默认设置。Molpro 中的一些程序，包括 DF-HF、DF-KS、(DF-)MULTI、DF-"
"TDDFT 和 PNO-LCCSD，也支持输入选项 ``implementation=disk`` 来为特定作业步骤启用磁盘选项。这些 MPI "
"文件的文件系统必须对所有处理器可访问。默认情况下，使用默认的 Molpro 临时目录，但也可以使用 ``-D`` 命令行选项或 "
"``MOLPRO_GLOBAL_SCRATCH`` 环境变量为 MPI 文件选择另一个目录。在单节点计算中，该目录可以是 tmpfs（例如，\\ "
"``-D /dev/shm``\\ ），在这种情况下，GA / MPI 文件保存在共享内存中。"

msgid ""
"The performance of the disk option varies depending on the I/O capacity, "
"available system memory, the MPI software, and the nature of the "
"calculation. Usually, the best practice is to reserve some system memory for"
" the system to buffer I/O operations (i.e., not to allocate all available "
"memory to Molpro with ``-m`` or the ``memory`` input card). When this is "
"done the performance of single-node disk-based calculations can be "
"comparable to GA-based ones in many cases, in particular with SSDs."
msgstr ""
"磁盘选项的性能取决于 I/O 容量、可用系统内存、MPI 软件以及计算的性质。通常，最佳实践是为系统保留一些系统内存以缓冲 I/O 操作（即，不要使用 "
"``-m`` 或 ``memory`` 输入卡将所有可用内存分配给 Molpro）。这样做之后，单节点基于磁盘的计算性能在许多情况下可以与基于 GA "
"的计算相媲美，尤其是在使用 SSD 时。"

msgid "Embarrassing parallel computation of gradients or Hessians (mppx mode)"
msgstr "梯度或 Hessian 矩阵的易并行计算（mppx 模式）"

msgid ""
"The numerical computation of gradients or Hessians, or the automatic "
"generation of potential energy surfaces, requires many similar calculations "
"at different (displaced) geometries. An automatic parallel computation of "
"the energy and/or gradients at different geometries is implemented for the "
"gradient, hessian, and surf programs. In this so-called mppx-mode, each "
"processing core runs an independent calculation in serial mode. This happens"
" automatically using the ``-n`` available cores. The automatic mppx "
"processing can be switched off by setting option ``mppx=0`` on the ``OPTG``,"
" ``FREQ``, or ``HESSIAN`` command lines. In this case, the program will "
"process each displacement in the standard parallel mode."
msgstr ""
"梯度或 Hessian 矩阵的数值计算，或势能面的自动生成，需要在不同（位移）几何结构下进行许多类似的计算。对于梯度、hessian 和 surf "
"程序，实现了在不同几何结构下能量和/或梯度的自动并行计算。在这种所谓的 mppx 模式下，每个处理核心以串行模式运行独立的计算。这会自动使用 "
"``-n`` 个可用核心。可以通过在 ``OPTG``\\ 、\\ ``FREQ`` 或 ``HESSIAN`` 命令行上设置选项 ``mppx=0``"
" 来关闭自动 mppx 处理。在这种情况下，程序将以标准并行模式处理每个位移。"

msgid "Options for developers"
msgstr "开发者选项"

msgid "Debugging options"
msgstr "调试选项"

msgid "``--ga-debug`` activates GA debugging statements."
msgstr "``--ga-debug`` 激活 GA 调试语句。"

msgid "``--check-collective`` check collective operations when debugging."
msgstr "``--check-collective`` 在调试时检查集体操作。"

msgid "Options for pure MPI-based PPIDD build"
msgstr "纯基于 MPI 的 PPIDD 构建选项"

msgid ""
"This section is **not** applicable if the Molpro binary release is used, or "
"when Molpro is built using the GlobalArrays toolkit (which we recommend)."
msgstr ""
"本节内容\\ **不**\\ "
"适用于使用Molpro二进制发行版的情况，也不适用于使用GlobalArrays工具包构建Molpro的情况（我们推荐使用此方式）。"

msgid ""
"``--node-helper-server`` specifies one helper server on every node if all "
"the nodes are symmetric and have reasonable processes (i.e., every node has "
"the same number of processes, and the number should be greater than 1), and "
"this is the default behaviour. Otherwise, only one single helper server for "
"all processes/nodes will be used, and this will be equivalent to option "
"``--single-helper-server``"
msgstr ""
"``--node-helper-server`` "
"指定每个节点上一个助手服务器，前提是所有节点对称且具有合理的进程数（即每个节点具有相同数量的进程，且该数量应大于1），这是默认行为。否则，将为所有进程/节点仅使用一个单独的助手服务器，这将等同于选项"
" ``--single-helper-server``"

msgid ""
"``--single-helper-server`` specifies only one single helper server for all "
"processes."
msgstr "``--single-helper-server`` 指定仅为所有进程使用一个单独的助手服务器。"

msgid "``--no-helper-server`` disables the helper server."
msgstr "``--no-helper-server`` 禁用助手服务器。"

msgid ""
"In the cases of one or more helper servers enabled, one or more processes "
"act as data helper servers, and the rest processes are used for computation."
" Even so, it is quite competitive in performance when it is run with a large"
" number of processes. In the case of helper server disabled, all processes "
"are used for computation; however, the performance may not be good because "
"of the poor performance of some existing implementations of the MPI-2 "
"standard for one-sided operations."
msgstr ""
"在启用一个或多个助手服务器的情况下，一个或多个进程充当数据助手服务器，其余进程用于计算。即便如此，当使用大量进程运行时，其性能仍然相当有竞争力。在助手服务器被禁用的情况下，所有进程都用于计算；然而，由于某些现有MPI-2标准单边操作实现的性能不佳，性能可能不理想。"
